WEBVTT

00:10.302 --> 00:11.303
[Squad Member] Over here!

00:11.303 --> 00:12.679
-I think I found someone.
-Units 11 and 16.

00:12.679 --> 00:13.680
-Hurry.
-Hurry up

00:13.680 --> 00:15.349
and search for survivors.

00:15.349 --> 00:17.267
The rest of you, you're coming with me.

00:17.267 --> 00:18.268
[Squad] Sir.

00:18.268 --> 00:19.770
[Yasochika] Leave the dead for later.

00:19.770 --> 00:21.730
The wounded are our priority right now.

00:22.648 --> 00:24.107
-He didn't make it.
-That one looks critical.

00:24.107 --> 00:25.859
Take him to room 203, hurry.

00:28.987 --> 00:32.115
(Isane sighing)

00:32.115 --> 00:35.536
Captain Unohana, was it
really the right thing

00:35.536 --> 00:38.705
for us to do, to remain
here in the barracks?

00:38.705 --> 00:41.208
We might've saved more
lives if we'd been out there

00:41.208 --> 00:42.668
-with the rest of the-
-Isane.

00:43.293 --> 00:46.672
We can't let our feelings
dictate our actions.

00:46.672 --> 00:48.882
The natural reaction
would have been for us

00:48.882 --> 00:50.676
to leave our posts out of concern.

00:52.219 --> 00:54.888
But I know you are not so
short-sighted that I need

00:54.888 --> 00:57.975
to explain to you why that
would have been wrong.

00:57.975 --> 01:00.060
We both know you're wiser than that.

01:01.562 --> 01:03.146
Right.

01:03.146 --> 01:05.315
I'm sorry, ma'am (sobs), forgive me!

01:06.483 --> 01:09.069
There's no need for tears, Isane.

01:09.069 --> 01:12.489
"Do not leave the Squad
4 barracks," he told us.

01:12.489 --> 01:13.824
"No matter what."

01:15.242 --> 01:18.662
Who knew that when the Head
Captain gave us those orders

01:19.413 --> 01:21.915
they would be the last
that he would ever give?

01:23.250 --> 01:26.003
(rain pattering)

01:32.634 --> 01:37.639
("Scar" by Tatsuya Kitani)

01:48.567 --> 01:51.904
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

01:51.904 --> 01:56.909
♪ The blue skies above
are hopelessly clear ♪

01:56.909 --> 02:01.914
♪ At my wit's end, I feel
a growing frustration ♪

02:02.414 --> 02:06.835
♪ As if to laugh at us hopeless cowards ♪

02:07.169 --> 02:10.297
♪ Countless eyes stare at us ♪

02:11.048 --> 02:16.929
♪ This soul of mine breaks again and again ♪

02:17.221 --> 02:20.098
♪ All I can do is hold it tight ♪

02:21.350 --> 02:26.438
♪ Until the day it turns to ash ♪

02:26.438 --> 02:29.358
♪ I've absorbed all of this sorrow ♪

02:29.358 --> 02:33.987
♪ It has shaped me, painted me ♪

02:33.987 --> 02:36.615
♪ But that's how we got here, right? ♪

02:36.615 --> 02:41.537
♪ One step at a time, just like breathing ♪

02:41.537 --> 02:44.331
♪ These countless scars on my palm ♪

02:44.331 --> 02:46.333
♪ That no longer fade ♪

02:46.333 --> 02:50.003
♪ Are my badge, my story ♪

02:50.254 --> 02:54.091
♪ I faced the fear and shred it to pieces ♪

02:54.091 --> 02:57.177
♪ And let it walk beside me once more ♪

02:57.177 --> 03:01.849
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

03:02.182 --> 03:07.187
-("Scar" by Tatsuya Kitani)
-(singing in Japanese)

03:16.613 --> 03:19.116
Kisuke Urahara wanted you
to know he's alive and well.

03:19.116 --> 03:21.743
And that Orihime Inoue
and Yasutora Sado

03:21.743 --> 03:23.287
are both safe, too.

03:23.287 --> 03:24.454
That's about it, Sir.

03:24.454 --> 03:26.456
We don't have any more
details than that.

03:27.374 --> 03:28.375
All right.

03:29.126 --> 03:30.377
What?

03:30.377 --> 03:32.129
That's a goddamn lie!

03:32.129 --> 03:33.088
There's no way.

03:33.088 --> 03:35.132
No way Captain Zaraki lost to that guy!

03:35.132 --> 03:36.466
[Nurse] You need to calm down.

03:36.466 --> 03:37.718
-Please.
-I need to see him!

03:37.718 --> 03:38.760
-Captain!
-Ichigo.

03:38.760 --> 03:40.929
You need some proper
medical treatment as well.

03:40.929 --> 03:42.472
Why don't you come along with me.

03:42.472 --> 03:44.308
Nah, I'm okay.

03:44.308 --> 03:46.810
They already looked me
over and bandaged me up.

03:46.810 --> 03:48.312
Come on, I'm not just talking about

03:48.312 --> 03:49.521
those scratches on your face!

03:49.521 --> 03:52.065
I can tell you've been
seriously wounded!

03:52.065 --> 03:53.483
Ichigo.

03:53.483 --> 03:56.320
Rukia and Abarai just
got out of surgery.

03:57.279 --> 03:58.572
TRAUMA ROOM

03:58.572 --> 04:00.532
They're no longer in critical condition.

04:00.532 --> 04:01.742
They're stable now.

04:03.577 --> 04:05.412
Just call me if you need anything.

04:09.166 --> 04:10.167
Ichigo.

04:10.167 --> 04:11.168
Rukia!

04:11.168 --> 04:13.212
Hey, you shouldn't even be talking.

04:11.418 --> 04:13.253
[Squad Member] This came for you, Sir.

04:13.212 --> 04:15.422
She just said we're
in stable condition,

04:15.422 --> 04:17.174
or have you gone deaf.

04:17.174 --> 04:18.675
On top of being dumb?

04:19.676 --> 04:20.677
Dumb huh?

04:20.677 --> 04:22.930
Sounds like your mouth
is working just fine.

04:24.181 --> 04:25.182
(heart monitor beeping)

04:25.182 --> 04:30.020
Ichigo, I knew you'd come to
help defend the Soul Society.

04:30.604 --> 04:31.605
Thank you.

04:31.605 --> 04:33.232
Of course I came.

04:33.232 --> 04:34.441
A little late, though.

04:34.441 --> 04:36.693
I can't say I was very much help.

04:36.693 --> 04:38.070
Shut up.

04:38.070 --> 04:41.281
You drove off the leader
of the enemy's forces.

04:41.281 --> 04:43.116
If you hadn't done what you did,

04:43.116 --> 04:45.619
things would've gotten
a whole lot worse.

04:45.619 --> 04:48.747
So hold your head up
high, you damn idiot.

04:48.747 --> 04:50.207
[Ichigo] If you say so.

04:50.207 --> 04:51.625
(Rukia chuckling)

04:51.625 --> 04:53.460
Pardon the intrusion, Sir.

04:53.460 --> 04:55.379
Captain Kurotsuchi wants to see you,

04:55.379 --> 04:56.797
regarding your Zanpakuto.

04:58.048 --> 05:00.592
-(rain pattering)
-(worrisome music)

05:00.592 --> 05:01.927
[Shinji] So typical.

05:01.927 --> 05:03.136
He's always running off somewhere,

05:03.136 --> 05:05.264
no matter what the situation is.

05:05.264 --> 05:06.974
I wish he'd sit still and think

05:06.974 --> 05:08.892
of his own well-being for once.

05:10.561 --> 05:11.979
Captain Hirako,

05:12.729 --> 05:15.315
did Ichigo seem different to you?

05:15.649 --> 05:17.484
He seemed troubled.

05:17.484 --> 05:19.820
Yeah, I couldn't help
noticing that as well.

05:20.654 --> 05:23.490
Though to be fair, his
Zanpakuto was broken.

05:23.490 --> 05:26.910
He's exhausted and disappointed
he couldn't do more.

05:26.910 --> 05:28.954
But I wouldn't worry
about him too much.

05:30.455 --> 05:32.332
I don't know.

05:32.332 --> 05:34.334
I think there's more to it than that.

05:36.336 --> 05:39.506
It seems like he's dealing
with something else.

05:39.506 --> 05:42.426
Something serious that
he's hiding from us.

05:43.343 --> 05:45.929
(gentle music)

05:47.514 --> 05:50.767
[Jushiro] The Head Captain's
body has yet to be found.

05:52.019 --> 05:54.688
The enemy destroyed virtually everything.

05:57.608 --> 05:59.610
I have an update, Sir.

05:59.610 --> 06:02.321
It appears that Squad
Captain Byakuya Kuchiki

06:02.321 --> 06:06.116
as well as Kenpachi Zaraki
have both managed to survive.

06:06.116 --> 06:08.785
But they have yet to
regain consciousness.

06:08.785 --> 06:10.704
It's unlikely they will be able to return

06:10.704 --> 06:12.873
to their duties any time soon.

06:12.873 --> 06:15.375
In fact, they may never
regain consciousness again,

06:15.375 --> 06:16.877
-it would seem-
-Get out!

06:16.877 --> 06:19.296
We've had enough grim
tidings for one day.

06:19.296 --> 06:20.589
Where have you been?

06:20.589 --> 06:23.300
Haven't you heard we lost
the Head Captain, you fool?

06:23.300 --> 06:25.469
How much more bad news
are we supposed to take?

06:25.469 --> 06:26.470
Get a grip.

06:26.470 --> 06:27.471
It's embarrassing.

06:27.471 --> 06:28.555
[Soi] Get a grip?

06:28.555 --> 06:30.057
That's easy for you to say!

06:30.057 --> 06:31.975
You guys have always
held a grudge against

06:31.975 --> 06:33.644
the Head Captain all these years!

06:33.644 --> 06:35.187
Don't you dare.

06:35.187 --> 06:36.605
Enough, Soi Fon!

06:36.813 --> 06:39.233
Do you think you're the
only one who feels shattered

06:39.233 --> 06:40.234
by our loss?

06:40.234 --> 06:41.235
(Soi gasping)

06:41.527 --> 06:42.903
Now, now.

06:42.903 --> 06:44.821
-No fighting, no fighting.
-(hands clapping)

06:44.821 --> 06:47.407
Play nice, everyone.

06:47.407 --> 06:50.577
If Old Man Yama was here to
see us squabbling like this,

06:50.577 --> 06:53.205
he'd give us all a
good smack on the head.

06:53.205 --> 06:55.832
Nor would he want
us standing around

06:55.832 --> 06:58.502
bawling our heads off over his memory.

06:58.502 --> 07:00.003
Shunsui, you bastard.

07:00.003 --> 07:02.506
Remember what our purpose is.

07:02.506 --> 07:05.050
The Thirteen Court
Guard Squads aren't here

07:05.050 --> 07:07.094
to mourn the Soul Society.

07:08.428 --> 07:11.598
Our only job is to
protect the Soul Society.

07:12.683 --> 07:14.768
Or at least what's left of it.

07:14.768 --> 07:18.272
So let's all just try and keep
moving forward, shall we?

07:19.356 --> 07:20.941
You can't fix it?

07:20.941 --> 07:22.025
Why can't you?

07:22.025 --> 07:24.194
What do you do when your
Zanpakuto gets broken?

07:24.194 --> 07:26.613
Are you really telling me
you can't fix your own?

07:26.613 --> 07:28.115
When will you learn?

07:28.115 --> 07:32.536
I have never fixed my Zanpakuto,
I have merely modified it.

07:33.036 --> 07:35.706
The only thing that
can fix a Zanpakuto

07:35.706 --> 07:38.709
is its owner's own mind
and Spiritual Pressure,

07:38.709 --> 07:40.711
and enough time to
infuse them both

07:40.711 --> 07:42.546
into the Zanpakuto itself.

07:42.546 --> 07:44.590
That's the only way.

07:44.590 --> 07:46.592
(sighs) Okay, fine.

07:46.592 --> 07:48.886
So what you're saying is,
I have to take it back

07:48.886 --> 07:50.637
and fix the damn thing myself.

07:50.637 --> 07:51.889
Not quite.

07:51.889 --> 07:53.432
I hadn't finished my explanation.

07:53.432 --> 07:54.474
Huh?

07:54.474 --> 07:56.727
That only applies to Shikai.

07:56.727 --> 07:58.312
If we're talking about the destruction

07:58.312 --> 08:01.982
of a Zanpakuto's Bankai,
then that's a bit trickier.

08:01.982 --> 08:04.234
Because once destroyed,
a Bankai can never

08:04.234 --> 08:06.486
in fact be restored, I'm sorry to say.

08:06.486 --> 08:07.487
What?

08:07.487 --> 08:08.488
Wait a minute.

08:09.031 --> 08:11.617
But then, what's that mean?

08:11.617 --> 08:13.285
(communicator beeping)

08:13.285 --> 08:14.620
Yes, I'm here.

08:15.829 --> 08:17.414
(door whooshing)

08:17.414 --> 08:18.415
(Kon screaming)

08:18.415 --> 08:20.000
-Get away from me.
-Come back here, you.

08:20.000 --> 08:21.585
-Kon?
-[Squad Member] Get him!

08:21.585 --> 08:24.796
What the heck is Kon doing
here in the Soul Society?

08:25.297 --> 08:26.840
-(door whooshing)
-I see.

08:26.840 --> 08:28.592
Just as I thought.

08:28.592 --> 08:29.843
Very well.

08:29.843 --> 08:32.304
-I'm headed there now.
-Huh?

08:32.304 --> 08:35.182
You can come with me, Ichigo Kurosaki.

08:35.182 --> 08:36.642
We're expecting visitors.

08:36.642 --> 08:38.352
And if I have to meet them,

08:38.352 --> 08:40.103
you should have to meet them, too.

08:40.854 --> 08:43.857
The great Squad Zero is on its way.

08:47.945 --> 08:49.613
-Shinji!
-Huh?

08:49.613 --> 08:51.532
Oh, you've come to
welcome them, too?

08:52.533 --> 08:54.159
You might regret this, Ichigo.

08:55.369 --> 08:58.121
Why's this Squad Zero coming now?

08:58.121 --> 09:02.125
I mean after the Seireitei's
been completely annihilated?

09:02.125 --> 09:04.294
Where have they been all this time?

09:04.294 --> 09:05.879
In the Royal Palace.

09:05.879 --> 09:09.216
Okay, but isn't that within the Seireitei?

09:09.216 --> 09:11.802
Remember how those
walls fell out of the sky

09:11.802 --> 09:13.512
when you first came here?

09:13.512 --> 09:14.680
(Ichigo gasping)

09:14.680 --> 09:16.515
Those walls have remained down,

09:16.515 --> 09:19.142
forming a barrier around
this area, ever since you

09:19.142 --> 09:20.978
and your friends got here.

09:20.978 --> 09:22.729
The walls were only ever intended

09:22.729 --> 09:25.566
to surround the Seireitei
during emergencies.

09:26.650 --> 09:28.902
Why is it then, they're
still down here,

09:28.902 --> 09:31.655
instead of where they
should be up in the sky,

09:31.655 --> 09:33.490
protecting the Royal Palace?

09:33.490 --> 09:34.491
(Ichigo gasping)

09:34.491 --> 09:35.742
Look, here they are.

09:35.742 --> 09:36.743
(Ichigo gasping)

09:38.579 --> 09:41.373
(ground rumbling)

09:44.877 --> 09:46.170
What is that?

09:46.170 --> 09:47.713
Tenchuren.

09:47.713 --> 09:50.257
Squad Zero uses it to get around in.

09:51.425 --> 09:54.386
It has plenty of room
for five squad members.

09:54.386 --> 09:55.387
[Ichigo] What?

09:55.387 --> 09:56.722
There's only five?

09:56.722 --> 09:59.016
[Shunsui] It's a squad of captains only.

09:59.016 --> 10:01.351
-Five of 'em.
-(door rumbling)

10:01.351 --> 10:03.854
But the combined
power of those five

10:05.063 --> 10:09.776
is greater than that of all the
Thirteen Court Guard Squads.

10:09.776 --> 10:12.613
(uplifting music)

10:25.125 --> 10:27.961
(ground rumbling)

10:29.171 --> 10:30.172
(flag flying)

10:30.172 --> 10:33.717
(dramatic music)

10:35.177 --> 10:36.553
Hell, yeah, that's right!

10:36.553 --> 10:40.390
We're here, drink it
in, we are finally here!

10:40.390 --> 10:43.894
The one and only Squad
Zero is in the house!

10:43.894 --> 10:46.188
Long time no see, you rookies!

10:46.188 --> 10:47.773
How've you been keeping
yourselves, huh?

10:47.773 --> 10:48.815
Have you been eating right,

10:48.815 --> 10:50.651
-getting enough sleep,
-I can't say these guys

10:50.651 --> 10:52.486
are exactly what I pictured they'd be.

10:52.486 --> 10:53.570
-(hand thudding)
-(Shinji yelling)

10:53.570 --> 10:55.239
What the hell was that for?

10:55.239 --> 10:58.033
It's been a while, hasn't it, Shinji?

10:58.033 --> 11:00.577
Hiyori isn't with you
today? How rare!

11:00.577 --> 11:01.537
It's been a while?

11:01.537 --> 11:03.163
I don't even know you.

11:03.163 --> 11:04.248
Wait.

11:04.248 --> 11:05.499
Hiyori?

11:05.499 --> 11:07.543
Have you forgotten who I am?

11:07.543 --> 11:08.544
It's me, Kirio!

11:08.544 --> 11:09.545
Remember?

11:09.545 --> 11:11.255
M-Miss Kirio?

11:11.255 --> 11:13.423
Whoa, you've, you've changed.

11:13.423 --> 11:15.008
You look completely different!

11:15.008 --> 11:17.427
Oh, Shinji, stop your teasing!

11:17.427 --> 11:19.596
I haven't changed all that much.

11:19.596 --> 11:22.099
-(stomach growling)
-Oh, I am starving!

11:26.562 --> 11:29.314
(chuckles) I bet you're happy
to see me again, Unohana.

11:29.314 --> 11:30.315
Are ya?

11:30.315 --> 11:32.401
So anyway, I'm curious,
have you been putting

11:32.401 --> 11:35.153
all those healing techniques
I taught you to good use?

11:35.153 --> 11:36.446
Yes, of course

11:36.446 --> 11:37.865
Ya sure about that?

11:37.865 --> 11:40.284
'Cause from what I heard,
you guys ended up having

11:40.284 --> 11:42.578
to bury a lot of your squad members.

11:42.578 --> 11:45.247
How do you explain that, hm?

11:45.247 --> 11:46.456
(Retsu sighing)

11:46.456 --> 11:47.666
Enough of that!

11:47.666 --> 11:50.460
I know you wanna kiss
and catch up, but save it

11:50.460 --> 11:52.963
'cause we've got bigger fish to fry!

11:52.963 --> 11:54.464
(Tenjiro groaning)

11:54.464 --> 11:57.885
Well, I see no one in Squad
Zero's changed very much,

11:57.885 --> 11:59.636
have they, Osho?

11:59.636 --> 12:03.807
So, what's made you decide to
bless us with your presence?

12:04.725 --> 12:06.101
Hmm.

12:06.101 --> 12:08.896
So this is Ichigo Kurosaki, huh?

12:10.230 --> 12:12.065
The Soul King ordered us to come

12:12.065 --> 12:16.486
and start rebuilding the
Thirteen Court Guard squads.

12:16.486 --> 12:18.989
And the first order of business

12:18.989 --> 12:22.075
is to take Ichigo back with us.

12:22.075 --> 12:23.660
You gotta be kidding!

12:23.660 --> 12:25.537
The great Squad Zero, huh?

12:25.537 --> 12:27.247
Cooling your heels up in the sky

12:27.247 --> 12:29.583
while the Seireitei
was being destroyed!

12:29.583 --> 12:32.002
And now you think you can
just come floating down here

12:32.002 --> 12:33.003
and pick up the pieces?

12:33.003 --> 12:35.255
What is this, some kind of joke?

12:36.423 --> 12:39.259
[Ichibe] Right, well,
anyway, as I was saying,

12:39.259 --> 12:40.302
-our orders are to-
-Hey.

12:40.302 --> 12:41.595
Shut up, will ya?

12:42.763 --> 12:44.348
What kind of move was that?

12:44.348 --> 12:47.226
The only joke around here is you.

12:47.643 --> 12:49.937
The Thirteen Court Guard Squads.

12:49.937 --> 12:52.606
Remind me what your job even is.

12:52.606 --> 12:55.609
I know our job's to
protect the Royal Palace.

12:55.609 --> 12:58.862
I always thought your job
was to protect the Seireitei.

12:58.862 --> 13:01.615
What kind of Court Guard
goes crying for help

13:01.615 --> 13:04.618
after failing at the
one job they've got?

13:04.618 --> 13:06.578
You're not even worthy of the name.

13:07.996 --> 13:08.997
-(fist thudding)
-(Tenjiro yelling)

13:08.997 --> 13:10.332
Hey, watch the hair!

13:10.999 --> 13:12.000
(Tenjiro thudding)

13:12.000 --> 13:14.378
I told you to save all that for later.

13:14.378 --> 13:17.548
Let's just finish gathering
up what we came here to get.

13:17.548 --> 13:18.882
[Senjumaru] No need.

13:18.882 --> 13:19.883
Hmm?

13:19.883 --> 13:21.009
I took care of it.

13:21.009 --> 13:23.887
Everything else on the list
of things we were sent to get

13:23.887 --> 13:25.514
is right here.

13:25.514 --> 13:28.559
-(dramatic music)
-(all gasping)

13:28.559 --> 13:31.228
That means the only
one remaining is you.

13:33.313 --> 13:35.649
Ichigo Kurosaki.

13:35.649 --> 13:37.484
Not possible.

13:37.484 --> 13:40.362
The three people you're
holding in those spheres

13:40.362 --> 13:42.322
are in absolutely no condition

13:42.322 --> 13:44.366
to leave the Seireitei right now.

13:44.366 --> 13:47.077
I cannot allow you to
take them with you.

13:47.077 --> 13:48.078
Hmm.

13:48.537 --> 13:51.123
Their condition is the reason
we're taking them with us,

13:51.123 --> 13:52.124
in the first place.

13:53.333 --> 13:55.752
Hey, you know as well as anyone,

13:55.752 --> 13:57.504
you haven't got the healing chops

13:57.504 --> 13:59.506
to make those three
rookies well again.

14:00.924 --> 14:05.012
You know it's true,
don't you, Retsu?

14:05.012 --> 14:07.931
Besides, you have more
important things than healing

14:07.931 --> 14:09.391
to be focused on right now.

14:12.853 --> 14:16.106
So I see you broke into my lab.

14:16.106 --> 14:17.691
You haven't changed.

14:17.691 --> 14:20.903
You're just as disrespectful as ever.

14:20.903 --> 14:24.531
Well, well, if it isn't
my dear old friend Mayuri.

14:24.531 --> 14:26.283
It's a bit of an exaggeration

14:26.283 --> 14:28.410
to say that I broke into your lab.

14:28.410 --> 14:30.871
The fact is, I was able to walk right in.

14:30.871 --> 14:33.749
I barely even had to touch the door.

14:33.749 --> 14:35.250
Really.

14:35.250 --> 14:37.920
It seems to me that security
has gotten a lot shabbier

14:37.920 --> 14:39.421
since I was around.

14:39.421 --> 14:40.422
(Mayuri scoffing)

14:40.422 --> 14:42.216
Wait. Back up just a minute?

14:42.216 --> 14:44.635
Did you guys say you
wanted to take me too?

14:44.635 --> 14:46.428
My wounds are nothing!

14:46.428 --> 14:48.639
I'll recover just fine
here in the Seireitei.

14:48.639 --> 14:49.806
Hmm.

14:49.806 --> 14:51.475
Yes, we know.

14:51.475 --> 14:55.312
But we'll be taking you for
an entirely different reason.

14:55.312 --> 14:56.772
And that is?

14:56.772 --> 14:58.649
[Kisuke] Hello there, everybody!

14:58.649 --> 15:01.109
Hey, sorry I didn't
get in touch sooner.

15:01.109 --> 15:03.153
I bet you were worried
about me, weren't you?

15:03.153 --> 15:06.573
Well, as you can see,
I'm fit as a fiddle!

15:06.573 --> 15:07.574
Hello?

15:07.574 --> 15:10.494
Wow, I was expecting a
little bit more of a welcome.

15:10.494 --> 15:11.912
-I mean-
-What's going on?

15:11.912 --> 15:13.413
Why did my head crack open?

15:13.413 --> 15:15.332
I've got light coming
out of my brain!

15:15.332 --> 15:16.959
-(Kon screaming)
-Ichigo!

15:16.959 --> 15:19.169
Oh, thank goodness
you're all right!

15:19.169 --> 15:21.255
Everything is okay over there, I hope?

15:21.255 --> 15:22.506
Just fine.

15:22.506 --> 15:23.507
How 'bout yourself?

15:23.507 --> 15:25.092
Are you doing all right?

15:25.092 --> 15:26.927
Yeah, I'm okay, don't worry.

15:28.512 --> 15:29.805
Ichigo!

15:29.805 --> 15:32.516
Oh man, am I glad you're safe.

15:32.516 --> 15:33.934
Right back at ya.

15:33.934 --> 15:36.478
I can't even begin to tell
ya how worried I've been.

15:36.478 --> 15:38.188
[Kisuke] Yeah, I know, I know.

15:38.188 --> 15:42.693
I wanted to contact you sooner,
but well a lot's happened.

15:42.693 --> 15:44.361
[Grimmjow] Hey, who are
you talking to in there?

15:44.361 --> 15:45.362
-Oh.
-Uh.

15:46.363 --> 15:48.031
Wait a second, that
sounds a lot like-

15:48.031 --> 15:49.616
[Grimmjow] Hey! I
know that voice!

15:49.616 --> 15:51.034
[Kisuke] Orihime!

15:51.034 --> 15:52.327
Chad, help!

15:52.327 --> 15:53.287
[Grimmjow] Ichigo, you bastard!

15:53.287 --> 15:54.538
-I know you're in there!
-No, no.

15:54.538 --> 15:55.622
-He isn't in here, honest.
-Kisuke,

15:55.622 --> 15:56.623
what the hell's he doing there?

15:56.623 --> 15:57.624
What's goin' on?

15:57.624 --> 16:01.295
Anyway, as you can see,
we're all perfectly fine

16:01.295 --> 16:02.880
on this end, Ichigo.

16:02.880 --> 16:06.383
So you just do what you have
to do, don't worry about us.

16:06.383 --> 16:09.553
It's okay to think about
yourself for a change.

16:09.553 --> 16:12.848
Go wherever your heart
tells you you should go.

16:12.848 --> 16:15.309
(Grimmjow yelling)

16:15.309 --> 16:18.312
Oh, and by the way, don't
give him a second thought.

16:18.312 --> 16:20.981
We've kind of come
to an arrangement.

16:20.981 --> 16:22.566
Well, see ya later!

16:25.736 --> 16:28.572
[Chad] Was it smart,
telling him that?

16:28.572 --> 16:29.698
Telling him what?

16:32.993 --> 16:34.494
Aah, I'm not worried about it,

16:34.494 --> 16:36.747
because if Ichigo does what
his heart tells him to do

16:36.747 --> 16:39.374
and nothing else I've
got a pretty good feeling

16:39.374 --> 16:40.834
that the world and all of us in it

16:40.834 --> 16:43.003
will be a lot better
off because of it.

16:43.170 --> 16:47.007
I mean, come on, you two should
know that better than I do.

16:49.426 --> 16:54.223
And believe me, the guy who
knows that better than anyone

16:54.223 --> 16:56.016
is Ichigo himself.

16:57.184 --> 16:58.769
[Ichigo] Hey, Baldy.

16:58.769 --> 17:01.188
Are you talking to me?

17:01.188 --> 17:03.607
[Ichigo] If I go to this
Royal Palace with you,

17:03.607 --> 17:06.276
will I be able to fix
my Tensa Zangetsu?

17:06.276 --> 17:07.945
Nope, that's impossible.

17:07.945 --> 17:10.697
Your sword can't be fixed.

17:10.697 --> 17:13.700
However, if you were to
come to the Royal Palace,

17:13.700 --> 17:15.452
we could re-forge it into something

17:15.452 --> 17:17.579
resembling your original sword.

17:21.583 --> 17:22.584
-Fine.
-Hm?

17:24.378 --> 17:25.546
Let's go, then.

17:25.546 --> 17:27.130
The Royal Palace it is.

17:28.131 --> 17:29.174
All right.

17:29.174 --> 17:31.134
-“WELCOME TO KUKAKU SHIBA’S RESIDENCE”
-Stand by for launch!

17:31.718 --> 17:32.719
Huh?

17:33.637 --> 17:35.722
And lift off!

17:37.558 --> 17:41.645
[Ichigo] Aren't there any
seat belts on this thing?

17:43.272 --> 17:44.565
[Ganju] There he goes.

17:44.565 --> 17:47.818
Are you sure it was the
right thing to do, Sis?

17:47.818 --> 17:48.986
Yeah.

17:48.986 --> 17:51.238
If he doesn't go now, the Soul Society

17:51.238 --> 17:53.740
is doomed when the
next invasion comes.

17:55.242 --> 17:57.119
It's not like we had a choice.

17:58.370 --> 18:00.914
We had to let him go
even if that means

18:00.914 --> 18:02.666
making our Uncle sad.

18:05.502 --> 18:08.672
Right, everyone back to
Kukaku's Great Training Hall,

18:08.672 --> 18:09.840
on the double!

18:09.840 --> 18:12.009
My brother's not going
to train himself.

18:12.009 --> 18:14.178
Don't forget who took
you in off the streets

18:14.178 --> 18:16.346
of the Rukon District.

18:16.346 --> 18:19.266
[Kugo] I hate the way she
keeps reminding us of that.

18:19.266 --> 18:20.642
[Giriko] You and me both.

18:20.642 --> 18:23.353
[Kukaku] Time for you
to step up, Ganju.

18:23.353 --> 18:24.938
You can complain all you want,

18:24.938 --> 18:27.191
but I'm throwing you
into the next battle.

18:28.275 --> 18:29.276
Got it.

18:32.196 --> 18:34.198
(ground rumbling)

18:34.198 --> 18:36.158
[Ichibe] You can get out now, Ichigo!

18:37.367 --> 18:38.368
We're here!

18:38.869 --> 18:41.205
THE ROYAL PALACE
The Royal Palace!

18:47.211 --> 18:49.796
(gentle music)

18:50.714 --> 18:52.132
So this is it.

18:52.132 --> 18:53.133
That's right!

18:53.133 --> 18:54.134
You're lucky.

18:54.134 --> 18:56.178
You might not be
aware of this, my boy,

18:56.178 --> 18:59.848
but Soul Reapers aren't
ordinarily allowed up here.

18:59.848 --> 19:03.519
But then, there's nothing
really ordinary about you,

19:03.519 --> 19:04.645
is there?

19:04.645 --> 19:06.688
So this is the place Aizen

19:06.688 --> 19:08.565
so desperately wanted to come to.

19:09.983 --> 19:11.318
Hey, wait a minute!

19:11.318 --> 19:12.319
Am I missing something?

19:12.319 --> 19:14.238
I thought you couldn't
get into the Royal Palace

19:14.238 --> 19:15.656
without the Ouken!

19:15.656 --> 19:17.741
(chuckles) It's here.

19:17.741 --> 19:20.327
Our bones are the Ouken.

19:20.327 --> 19:22.663
That's right, they were
transformed by the power

19:22.663 --> 19:25.082
of the Soul King when
we were selected by him

19:25.082 --> 19:27.334
to join Squad Zero.

19:27.334 --> 19:30.337
You see, there are only
two ways to gain entrance

19:30.337 --> 19:31.755
to the Royal Palace.

19:31.755 --> 19:35.259
Either we choose to allow you
in or you come in with us.

19:36.677 --> 19:40.013
Sosuke Aizen was trying
to make an imitation Ouken

19:40.013 --> 19:41.014
of his own.

19:41.014 --> 19:42.516
In other words, he was trying

19:42.516 --> 19:46.728
to use his own spiritual
powers to create clones of us.

19:46.728 --> 19:50.065
He wanted to make
himself into a new god.

19:50.065 --> 19:53.360
By killing the king, as
well as millions of others.

19:55.571 --> 19:57.447
Sosuke Aizen.

19:57.447 --> 20:00.075
He truly is evil personified.

20:01.034 --> 20:03.871
But know this, Ichigo Kurosaki,

20:05.289 --> 20:07.541
the Quincies you are now facing

20:07.541 --> 20:10.711
are an even greater
and more terrible evil.

20:10.711 --> 20:13.797
(Ichigo grunting)

20:13.797 --> 20:15.549
All right, ready?

20:15.549 --> 20:17.217
I'm gonna blast you off now!

20:17.217 --> 20:18.552
Stand right there!

20:18.552 --> 20:21.096
Don't move, or you'll die!

20:21.096 --> 20:23.056
Okay, here goes.

20:23.056 --> 20:24.808
Wait, hold on a second!

20:24.808 --> 20:25.809
What is it?

20:25.809 --> 20:27.311
I don't even know where
the hell I'm headed!

20:27.311 --> 20:29.229
Am I going to meet the Soul King?

20:29.229 --> 20:30.230
Huh?

20:30.230 --> 20:31.773
Come on, you're not serious, are ya?

20:31.773 --> 20:34.067
There's no way a punk
like you is ever gonna

20:34.067 --> 20:35.319
meet the Soul King.

20:35.319 --> 20:36.445
-What did I say
-Try explaining it

20:36.445 --> 20:37.487
-about the hair?
-to him properly!

20:37.821 --> 20:39.615
-THE ROYAL PALACE – MAIN ENTRANCE
-Now listen closely.

20:39.615 --> 20:41.825
Right now, we're at
the main entrance.

20:41.825 --> 20:43.869
-REIO GREATER PALACE
-Over there is the main shrine,

20:43.869 --> 20:45.746
the Reio Greater Palace.

20:45.746 --> 20:48.165
That's where the Soul King resides.

20:48.165 --> 20:49.875
-SQUAD ZERO RIDEN
-And those five disc-like structures

20:49.875 --> 20:53.504
floating around it are the Squad Zero Riden.

20:53.504 --> 20:55.797
Those are our castles.

20:55.797 --> 20:56.840
You got that?

20:56.840 --> 20:58.675
You see, there's five of 'em.

20:58.675 --> 21:01.261
But forget the other
four, it's my Kirinden

21:01.261 --> 21:02.304
that you're coming to.

21:02.304 --> 21:04.348
Meaning you and your friends.

21:05.724 --> 21:06.725
“KIRINDEN”

21:07.351 --> 21:09.895
(Ichigo sighing)

21:09.895 --> 21:11.230
[Ichigo] What the hell is this?

21:11.230 --> 21:12.397
[Tenjiro] What's it look like?

21:12.397 --> 21:14.358
Haven't you ever seen
a hot spring, before.

21:14.358 --> 21:15.984
[Ichigo] Why are they underwater?

21:15.984 --> 21:17.611
You're gonna drown them!

21:17.611 --> 21:20.322
-Look, he's bleeding!
-Calm down.

21:20.322 --> 21:22.032
I'm soaking them in the hot spring

21:22.032 --> 21:24.785
in order to drain out their
damaged Spiritual Pressure

21:24.785 --> 21:26.119
along with their blood.

21:26.119 --> 21:27.955
Damaged Spiritual Pressure?

21:27.955 --> 21:31.333
You see that boiling,
red-hot spring over there?

21:31.333 --> 21:33.710
-“BLOOD POND HELL”
-[Ichigo] (gasps) Blood Pond Hell?

21:33.710 --> 21:36.213
[Tenjiro] Right, Blood Pond Hell.

21:36.213 --> 21:40.676
So we're gonna take Byakuya
here, who's all drained out

21:40.676 --> 21:42.135
and toss him in there!

21:42.135 --> 21:43.345
Hey, what are you doing?

21:43.345 --> 21:44.805
You're gonna kill the guy.

21:44.805 --> 21:47.140
Would you please calm the hell down?

21:47.140 --> 21:49.518
I draw out their blood
in White Bone Hell

21:49.518 --> 21:52.312
and replenish it in Blood Pond Hell.

21:52.312 --> 21:54.565
Repeat the process a few times

21:54.565 --> 21:56.692
and eventually, every
drop of bad blood

21:56.692 --> 21:58.193
and Spiritual Pressure in their bodies

21:58.193 --> 22:01.238
will be swapped out for
pure, hot, healthy water.

22:01.238 --> 22:02.698
That's the way I heal 'em.

22:03.073 --> 22:04.741
I find it a little hard to believe

22:04.741 --> 22:05.742
that this thing is gonna-

22:05.742 --> 22:07.369
Just shut up and start soaking.

22:07.369 --> 22:09.246
For the kind of injuries you have,

22:10.414 --> 22:11.915
one night should do it.

22:11.915 --> 22:14.877
That's all it'll take to make
you twice as good as new.

22:14.877 --> 22:16.670
-“HOT SPRING DEMON” – TENJIRO KIRINJI
-(dramatic music)

22:19.089 --> 22:24.094
("Saihate" by SennaRin)

22:24.136 --> 22:27.306
♪ Everything we had left behind ♪

22:27.306 --> 22:31.518
♪ Our breaths blending as mist ♪

22:31.518 --> 22:36.148
♪ without form or expression ♪

22:36.148 --> 22:40.277
♪ We lie buried as we
glare into the distance ♪

22:40.652 --> 22:43.405
♪ I can't hear anything ♪

22:43.405 --> 22:46.325
♪ I can't seem to cut anything ♪

22:46.325 --> 22:49.161
♪ It feels like I'm sinking ♪

22:49.161 --> 22:51.038
♪ Falling, falling ♪

22:51.038 --> 22:52.122
♪ Touching ♪

22:52.122 --> 22:55.667
♪ Eyes struck wide open ♪

22:55.667 --> 22:59.004
♪ Something no one has ever seen ♪

22:59.004 --> 23:05.302
♪ The furthest reaches
are now visible to us ♪

23:05.302 --> 23:09.306
♪ It cannot be undone
and cannot be stopped ♪

23:09.306 --> 23:12.726
♪ This ensuing struggle ♪

23:12.726 --> 23:17.314
♪ Whisk it away beyond
the ends of the earth ♪

23:17.314 --> 23:19.358
♪ Along with our breaths ♪

23:19.816 --> 23:21.193
♪ Take everything ♪

23:21.193 --> 23:26.031
♪ Whisk it away beyond
the ends of the earth ♪

23:26.031 --> 23:28.033
♪ Along with our futures ♪

23:28.033 --> 23:29.743
♪ Along with our world ♪

23:30.827 --> 23:34.248
♪ Something no one has ever seen ♪

23:34.248 --> 23:40.629
♪ The furthest reaches
are now visible to us ♪

23:40.629 --> 23:42.589
♪ Don't you know God's demand? ♪

23:42.756 --> 23:44.424
♪ Don't you know God's demand? ♪

23:44.424 --> 23:48.053
♪ As we tear each other down. ♪

23:52.850 --> 23:54.142
[Ichibe] Hmm?

23:58.522 --> 24:02.943
Ah, so you're awake, Soul King.

24:03.819 --> 24:06.613
(mystical music)

24:11.326 --> 24:16.331
[Kenpachi] Neither form nor
soul will escape my blade.

24:16.707 --> 24:19.209
Nothing except you.

24:22.337 --> 24:27.342
-("Saihate" by SennaRin)
-(singing in Japanese)
